Search TODO/FIXME/BUG/HACK keywords scoped to the cyberdeck only. Vendored
engine: the consult-todo package is embedded below as loader-managed
source (no straight) with all symbols renamed `consult-todo-*` →
`cyberdeck-search-todo-*` so the original straight `consult-todo` module is
untouched. Search scope is the AIUs directory `(my/cyberdeck-root-dir)`.

Depends on `hl-todo` (still a straight package, provides
`hl-todo--search`, `hl-todo--regexp`, `hl-todo-keyword-faces`) and `consult`.

Commands:
- `cyberdeck-search-todo-all` — scan buffers visiting files in the AIUs directory
- `cyberdeck-search-todo-dir` — scan TODO keywords in the AIUs directory
- `cyberdeck-search-todo` — current buffer
- `cyberdeck-search-todo-clear-cache` — clear the dir search cache

AIU: vault AIUs are EXTENSIONLESS (no `.org`). `cyberdeck-search-todo--dir-files`
accepts extensionless files AND `.org`, and skips `.git`/`admin`/`.cache`.
Scanning is pure-Lisp (`re-search-forward` on `hl-todo--regexp`) — do NOT use
`rgrep`, whose shell pipeline chokes on the hl-todo regexp (`expected operator`),
and do NOT use `hl-todo--search` for file scanning (it only matches comments/
strings or text-derived modes, returning nil in a plain temp buffer).

